    "title": "New Coffee Shop Planned on North Hercules Avenue in Clearwater - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Neil Cooney ,\n21 hours ago The intersection of North Hercules Avenue and Sunset Point Road in Clearwater appears to be welcoming a new coffee shop into the mix. According to a plan review submitted by Covenant Coffee House LLC, this new coffee spot would open in the small retail center on the intersection’s northwest corner, at 1909 N Hercules Ave. Read full article\n1",
